<title>USA: TABLE - Borden Chemicals Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Borden Chemicals Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMUS, Ohio 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    June 30,</p>
<p>					     1997	     1996</p>
<p>Revenues				  189.8	    179.2</p>
<p>Gross profit			     34.1	     14.0</p>
<p>Net income				$21.2	    $ 1.5</p>
<p>Per Unit Data</p>
<p>Net income				$0.57	    $0.04</p>
<p>Cash distribution</p>
<p>   declared			     $0.45	    $0.00</p>
<p>Average units			    36.8	     36.8</p>
<p>						Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						    June 30,</p>
<p>					     1997	    1996</p>
<p>Revenues				  384.5	    349.8</p>
<p>Gross profit			     40.8	     19.8</p>
<p>Net income				$16.8	   ($ 4.6)</p>
<p>Per Unit Data</p>
<p>Net income				$0.45	   ($0.12)</p>
<p>Cash distribution</p>
<p>   declared			     $0.55	    $0.10</p>
<p>Average units			    36.8		6.8</p>
<p>(In millions, except per Unit data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Borden Chemicals and Plastics Limited Partnership.</p>
<p>Improved results attributed to higher average selling prices and margins in PVC resins business, together with lower natural gas costs and good profitability in methanol business.</p>
</text>
